    <briefdescription>
<para>A class that can track all registers with locations in a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1dwarf_1_1_unwind_row" kindref="compound">UnwindRow</ref> object. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_register" kindref="compound">Register</ref> locations use a map where the key is the register number and the the value is a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1dwarf_1_1_unwind_location" kindref="compound">UnwindLocation</ref>.</para>
<para>The register maps are put into a class so that all register locations can be copied when parsing the unwind opcodes DW_CFA_remember_state and DW_CFA_restore_state. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
